        {
          "fact": "F4",
          "source": "def-qft-fock-and-test-spaces",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "quote": "second-variable-linear pairing $\\langle u,v\\rangle_2:=(v,u)_1$, where $(\\cdot,\\cdot)_1$ is the first-variable-linear Hilbert pairing of [[def-real-and-complex-inner-product-space]]. Thus $\\langle u,v\\rangle_2$ is linear in $v$ and conjugate-linear in $u$. For each tensor product, use the same norm completion as [[lem-nrqm-composites-hilbert-tensor-construction]],",
