          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For every $f\\in\\mathcal S(\\mathbb R^n)$ and every $x\\in\\mathbb R^n$, $$f(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^n}\\widehat f(\\xi)e^{2\\pi ix\\cdot\\xi}\\,d\\xi.$$ The integral is absolutely convergent.",
