          "status": "current published mathematical supplier; exact interface inspected",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "exact_statement": "For vectors $u,v$ in a real or complex inner product space, $$|\\langle u,v\\rangle|\\le\\lVert u\\rVert\\lVert v\\rVert.$$ Equality holds if and only if $u$ and $v$ are linearly dependent, including the case in which either vector is zero.",
